+## Context
+
+`priceOrder` in `src/pricing.ts` passes the gross total to `couponDiscount`, though the README applies coupons to the subtotal after volume discounts. `Coupons.redeemable` in `src/coupons.ts` compares the order date to `validUntil` with `>= 0`, which rejects the last day.
+
+## Goals / Non-Goals
+
+**Goals:** match the README for the coupon base and the validity period.
+**Non-Goals:** shipping VAT (the README says 22%; unchanged), any API change.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Pass `grossTotal - volumeTotal` as the base to `couponDiscount`; keep `capped` measured against the gross total as the README states.
+- Change the expiry test to `> 0` so only dates after `validUntil` are refused.
