+# order-discounts Specification
+
+## Purpose
+Defines how volume discounts and coupons apply to an order (coupon base and validity period), so that orders match the business rules in the README.
+
+## Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Coupon applies to the subtotal after volume discounts
+The system SHALL compute a percentage coupon on the order's subtotal after volume discounts, and a fixed coupon SHALL never take off more than that subtotal. All discounts together SHALL still not exceed 50% of the gross amount.
+
+#### Scenario: Percentage coupon with a volume discount
+- **WHEN** an order has 12 units at 500 cents (gross 6000, volume discount 600) and a 10% coupon
+- **THEN** the coupon takes 540 cents off and the goods amount is 4860 cents
+
+#### Scenario: Fixed coupon larger than the subtotal
+- **WHEN** a fixed coupon exceeds the subtotal after volume discounts
+- **THEN** it takes off no more than that subtotal, within the 50% cap
+
+### Requirement: Coupon is valid through its last day
+The system SHALL accept a coupon on every day from its first day to its last day, both included.
+
+#### Scenario: Order on the last day
+- **WHEN** a coupon valid until 2026-11-30 is used on an order dated 2026-11-30
+- **THEN** the coupon is accepted
+
+#### Scenario: Order the day after
+- **WHEN** the order is dated 2026-12-01
+- **THEN** the coupon is refused as expired
